  (text "Input: WAGO J1 from a PDH/PDP breaker slot (10-20 A).  Q3 = low-side reverse-polarity FET, D1 = 16 V TVS." (at 20 32 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 90fd2948-1b28-4fe6-a95b-c3e7c6498664))
  (text "Buck leg uses external FETs Q1/Q2; boost leg FETs are inside U1." (at 160 32 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 7026e95f-a785-4a13-a1f6-414e06efa25b))
  (text "UVLO rising = 1.23 V x (1 + R3/R4) = 5.5 V    FSW: R5 49.9k = 400 kHz    ILIM: R9 22.1k = 14.9 A avg    MODE: tied to GND = internal LDO, forced PWM" (at 60 105 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 713b0481-005e-4c43-9ee7-6ac8e19c80f0))
